{"id":"h01-62","volume":1,"volumeTitle":"人间词话","volumeSubtitle":"六十四则","index":62,"title":{"t":"淫詞、鄙詞、遊詞","s":"淫词、鄙词、游词"},"book":{"t":"人間詞話","s":"人间词话"},"sourceHead":{"t":"國粹學報本","s":"国粹学报本"},"author":"王国维","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"「从前是歌舞人家的女儿，如今是出门浪游的人的妻子。那人走了不回来，空床很难一个人守着。」以及「为什么不催动好马，先占住要道上的渡口？不要守着贫贱，在坎坷里长时间吃苦。」这两段可以算淫和鄙的极端。","tokens":[{"t":"「","s":"「","punct":true},{"t":"昔","s":"昔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"爲","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"倡","s":"倡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"家","s":"家","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"女","s":"女","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"今","s":"今","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"爲","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"蕩","s":"荡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"婦","s":"妇","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true},{"t":"蕩","s":"荡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"行","s":"行","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歸","s":"归","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"空","s":"空","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"床","s":"床","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"難","s":"难","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"獨","s":"独","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"守","s":"守","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true},{"t":"」","s":"」","punct":true},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"「","s":"「